<title>USA: Alltel doubles size of stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Alltel doubles size of stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alltel Corp said Thursday that it has expanded its share repurchase program to seven million shares from 3.5 million shares.</p>
<p>The company recently completed repurchase of the initial 3.5 million shares authorized in October, 1996.  </p>
<p>Last week, Alltel reported earnings of $0.54 a share on an average of 188.0 million shares outstanding, compared with $0.44 a share on an average of 190.6 million shares the previous firt quarter.</p>
</text>
